      en: ["The park was officially opened to the public in 1995.", "The total area of the park grounds is approximately 105 hectares.", "Tiên Đồng Beach is Vietnam's first artificial seawater beach.", "The park's crocodile farm is home to over 15,000 crocodiles.", "The park houses a monumental statue of the deity Quán Thế Âm.", "The annual Southern Fruit Festival has been held here since 2004."],
